  "key_observations_html": "<div style=\"border:1px solid #C7D8E8;border-radius:10px;padding:0.75rem 0.95rem;margin:0.1rem 0 0.55rem;background:#ffffff;box-shadow:0 1px 3px rgba(15,23,42,0.06);\"><ul style=\"margin:0.1rem 0 0 1.05rem;padding:0;color:#1F4C67;font-size:0.9rem;line-height:1.45;\"><li><strong>Stablecoin printed metrics were roughly flat this week:</strong> Market Cap near $306.32B (+1.3% 30D) means crypto dollar liquidity did not re-price hard\u2014incremental demand is coming from product and banking-rail headlines rather than a market-cap surge. Related: <a href=\"https://www.coindesk.com/policy/2026/09/22/european-central-banks-push-to-expand-stablecoin-yield-ban-to-crypto-lending-and-staking\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">European central banks push to expand stablecoin yield ban to crypto lending and staking</a> (CoinDesk).</li><li><strong>Stablecoin market structure remains concentration-led:</strong> leadership is still defined by a small set of large issuers/platforms; share shifts matter as much as aggregate market-cap growth. Related: <a href=\"https://www.theblock.co/news/business/2026-09-22-sofi-begins-stablecoin-settlement-on-mastercard-network-for-program-expected-to-exceed-25-billion-in-annualized-volume-416035\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">SoFi begins stablecoin settlement on Mastercard network for program expected to exceed $25 billion in annualized volume</a> (The Block).</li><li><strong>Bank rails are pushing stablecoins into treasury workflows:</strong> That pushes demand toward treasury and settlement use cases, not only exchange trading liquidity. Related: <a href=\"https://cointelegraph.com/news/escb-new-stablecoin-liquidity-rules-bank-risks?utm_source=rss_feed&amp;utm_medium=rss&amp;utm_campaign=rss_partner_inbound\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">ECB, EU cenbanks seek changes in MiCA\u2019s minimum bank deposit for stablecoins</a> (CoinTelegraph).</li></ul><p class=\"takeaways__note\">Context only\u2014not investment advice. Bullets combine on-page data with recent industry headlines.</p></div><p class=\"review-note ko-disclaimer\">Key observations are AI generated and should be reviewed for accuracy.</p>",
